    "text": "By County Herald Weather Center ,\n4 hours ago Country Herald is Local News, Independent Pulse. Covering breaking local news, sports, lifestyle and events. Pueblo, Colorado – Strong winds and a sharp change in temperatures are expected to impact much of southern Colorado on Friday as a cold front moves across the region, creating hazardous travel conditions and prompting a High Wind Watch for the far southeast plains. According to the National Weather Service in Pueblo, warmer conditions are […] This content first appeared on CountryHerald.com and is protected by copyright law. Unauthorized reproduction, redistribution, or republication of this content, in whole or in part, without expressed written permission from Country Herald is strictly prohibited. Violators may be subject to legal action. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
